            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Peak hours are scheduled departures from 5:00 a.m. through 9:59 a.m. and from 4:00 p.m. through 7:59 p.m.; all other departure hours are classified as off-peak. Blue bars show operated-flight volume, while orange marks show the percentage of flights departing at least 15 minutes late. Overnight delay rates should be interpreted alongside their substantially lower flight counts.</run>
