              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6734' id='9' type-v2='text' w='98720' x='640' y='92511'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Airline delay rates should be interpreted alongside delayed-flight volume because larger airlines may record more delayed flights simply by operating more flights. The yearly chart shows changes across available years only. Data for 2020 and 2021 are unavailable, and airlines without observations in a given year are not connected across that gap.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
