          <zone h='5761' id='11' type-v2='text' w='98022' x='989' y='93148'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Airports include only origins with at least 200,000 operated flights, while routes include only pairs with at least 50,000 flights. These thresholds reduce unstable comparisons based on small samples. Routes are directional, so ORD–LGA and LGA–ORD are treated separately.</run>
            </formatted-text>
