            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Each departure-delayed flight was assigned to the reported cause with the largest number of cause-specific delay minutes. This represents its primary reported cause and does not imply that other factors were absent. Severity statistics include only flights departing at least 15 minutes late.</run>
